  "solution": "Given equation: 20 - 10 × 342 ÷ 19 + 51 = 211\n\n1. 51 and 20, - and +\n\n⇒ 51 + 10 × __**342 ÷ 19**__ - 20 = 211\n\n⇒ 51 + **__10 × __****__18__** - 20 = 211\n\n⇒ __**51 + 180 **__- 20 = 211\n\n⇒ __**231 - 20**__ = 211\n\n⇒ 211 = 211\n\n2. 20 and 342, - and ÷\n\n⇒ __**342 ÷ 10**__ × 20 - 19 + 51 = 211\n\n⇒ __**34.2**____** × **____**20**__ - 19 + 51 = 211\n\n⇒ __**684**__ - 19 __**+ 51**__ = 211\n\n⇒ __**735 - 19**__ = 211\n\n⇒ 716 ≠ 211\n\n3. 10 and 20, - and ×\n\n⇒ 10 × 20 - 342 ÷ 19 + 51 = 211\n\n⇒ 10 × 20 - __**342 ÷ 19**__ + 51 = 211\n\n⇒ __**1**____**0 × 2**____**0**__ - 18 + 51 = 211\n\n⇒ __**200**__ - 18 **__+ 51__ **= 211\n\n⇒ __**251 - 18**__ = 211\n\n⇒ 233 ≠ 211\n\n4. 19 and 342, × and ÷\n\n⇒ 20 - __**10 ÷ 19 × 342**__ + 51 = 211\n\n⇒ __**20**__ - 180 __**+ 51**__ = 211\n\n⇒ __**71**____** - 180**__ = 211\n\n⇒ -109 ≠ 211\n\nHence, ‘**51 and 20, - and +**’ is the correct answer.",
